{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>He will atone for you.</b> The priest, therefore the commentators said concerning the scapegoat: for it stands alive to make atonement, because its standing is atonement." "<b>From all your sins.</b> As I explained, the term חטאת is a general term; therefore you will find it applied both to unintentional and to intentional transgression."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:29.079162848Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}